label "Mode 4, runnable knowledge: a selection of Concepts goes through the combiner's five fixed steps to a Harness of seven files (highlighted), which runtimes render"
caption "The highlighted Harness exists only for a valid selection; runtimes such as GABBE or kaiban-distributed are renderings of its seven files."
box sel 16 100 100 50 "select|Concepts"
box comb 148 90 120 70 "combiner|5 fixed steps|no model, no key"
box harn 300 90 140 70 "Harness|7 files: C4, arc42,|ADRs, gates, skills" acc
box rt 300 190 140 40 "runtime renderings"
arrow sel comb
arrow comb harn
arrow harn rt
note "verdict first — an invalid selection yields no Harness at all"
